Generating new ICRC HQ keys for demo purposes...
🚀 ICRC Blockchain API Gateway running on http://localhost:3000
📋 Available endpoints:
   GET  /health           - Health check
   GET  /ledger           - View entire ledger
   GET  /ledger/:id       - View history of specific kit
   POST /add-kit          - Add new medical kit
   GET  /audit            - Audit blockchain integrity

📊 Prediction Market Endpoints (Phase 6):
   GET  /api/markets      - Get all prediction markets
   GET  /api/markets/:id  - Get specific market
   POST /api/markets      - Create new market (Admin)
   POST /api/markets/:id/buy  - Buy shares
   POST /api/markets/:id/sell - Sell shares
   GET  /api/leaderboard  - Get top forecasters
   POST /api/markets/:id/resolve - Resolve market
